  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Running the Route reprise**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Just a Rambler**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n- **Think of What You've Done**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **Burn the Other End**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Our Last Goodbye**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2026-07-14.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 80 min [1]. Said about its sound: Venue acoustics are mediocre and crowd noise is heavy, so the recording is only fair but listenable; a faulty mic cable ruined set one [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2026-07-14.flac24**: taped by tunegrabber; transferred by Zappafan2; source: FOB Sennheiser MKE2's>Marantz PMD620 master [1]. Also: Taped by tunegrabber from the floor about 40 feet back, center, using Sennheiser MKE2 mics into a Marantz PMD620; Master was processed in Audacity at 24-bit/48kHz and converted to FLAC; the recording covers only the second set [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by AllEvents: [Billy Strings Roanoke July 14 2026 Berglund Center Coliseum Live Concert](https://allevents.in/roanoke/billy-strings-roanoke-july-14-2026-berglund-center-coliseum-live-concert/100001988454278274) [3]\n- Poster by happeningnext.com: [Billy Strings at Berglund Center, Roanoke on 14th July, 2026](https://happeningnext.com/event/billy-strings-eid1invsr7e4lf) [4]",
